<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Not by works I stand, but by grace alone,</l><l>In His mercy shown, love to me made known.</l><l>Found in Christ my King, in His truth I ’bide;</l><l>In His righteousness, I’m justified.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All the world may claim treasures bright and bold,</l><l>But in Christ alone, I have wealth untold.</l><l>Not by past or pride, nor by things I’ve done,</l><l>But by faith in Him, the victory’s won.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Pressing on I go, leaving self behind,</l><l>With my eyes on Him, true life now I find.</l><l>All my worth and gain don’t deserve my care;</l><l>Nothing with the love of Christ compares.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
